---
---
<section class="reviews-section" id="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header animate-fadeUp">
      <div class="chip">⭐ Customer Reviews</div>
      <h2>3,847+ Happy Relocations</h2>
      <p>Real stories from families and businesses who moved with PackersHub.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="reviews-grid">
      <div class="review-card animate-fadeUp">
        <div class="rv-badge">Verified ✓</div>
        <div class="rv-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="rv-text">"Moved from Nellore to Hyderabad. Exceptional service! The team was punctual and handled everything with extreme care. Not a single scratch on my furniture."</p>
        <div class="rv-user">
          <div class="rv-avatar">SR</div>
          <div>
            <div class="rv-name">Srinivas Reddy</div>
            <div class="rv-loc">Nellore → Hyderabad</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="review-card animate-fadeUp" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="rv-badge">Verified ✓</div>
        <div class="rv-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="rv-text">"Relocated our entire office in Chennai over a weekend. Monday morning we were back to work without any issues. Highly professional and efficient."</p>
        <div class="rv-user">
          <div class="rv-avatar">AM</div>
          <div>
            <div class="rv-name">Arun Mehta</div>
            <div class="rv-loc">Office Relocation, Chennai</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="review-card animate-fadeUp" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="rv-badge">Verified ✓</div>
        <div class="rv-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="rv-text">"I was worried about my car transport to Bangalore. But PackersHub's enclosed carrier was perfect. My car arrived showroom-fresh on time."</p>
        <div class="rv-user">
          <div class="rv-avatar">PV</div>
          <div>
            <div class="rv-name">Priya Venkatesh</div>
            <div class="rv-loc">Vijayawada → Bengaluru</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .reviews-section { padding: 80px 0; background: var(--bg); }
  .reviews-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .review-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 32px;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s;
  }
  .review-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }
  .rv-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    background: #DCFCE7;
    color: #166534;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .rv-stars { color: var(--gold); font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .rv-text { font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .rv-user { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .rv-avatar {
    width: 44px; height: 44px;
    background: var(--primary-light);
    color: var(--primary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .rv-name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-primary); font-size: 15px; }
  .rv-loc { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); }

  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .reviews-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .reviews-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
